{"id":"38500c05a94778d2","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-closure-base-change.md","title":"Theorem — 闭包的换基自然性与稠密单射上的闭子对象","display":"Theorem — 闭包的换基自然性与稠密单射上的闭子对象","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-closure-base-change","aliases":["14-thm-closure-base-change"],"display":"Theorem — 闭包的换基自然性与稠密单射上的闭子对象","source_ref":"V.1 Proposition 1; V.2 Lemma 3, printed pp.225–226; DjVu118–119","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-closure-base-change"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-closure-base-change</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 闭包的换基自然性与稠密单射上的闭子对象"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"V.1 Proposition 1; V.2 Lemma 3, printed pp.225–226; DjVu118–119"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce0c3e433ca617db\" href=\"?note=ce0c3e433ca617db\" title=\"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism\">14-df-j-dense-monomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1289398555ba3eed\" href=\"?note=1289398555ba3eed\" title=\"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations\">14-df-subobject-lattice-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为 LT 拓扑。将 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2ca2aad80752c90\" href=\"?note=f2ca2aad80752c90\" title=\"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure\">14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure</a> 的闭包显式记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}\\)</span>，其定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:Y\\to X\">\\(f:Y\\to X\\)</span> 为任意箭头，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow B\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow B\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span>-稠密单射。下式定义闭子对象集合及函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_m,T_m\">\\(R_m,T_m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:D\\hookrightarrow A\">\\(v:D\\hookrightarrow A\\)</span> 是输入子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[v]\">\\([v]\\)</span> 的任意代表。所有子对象序、逆像和像使用本书内建定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(X)\\)</span> 是本条新定义的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Im}\">\\(\\mathrm{Im}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a> 的像函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_S:S\\to S\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_S:S\\to S\\)</span> 在本条的闭子对象集合上表示集合恒等函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(X)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\mid\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}(U)=U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(X)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\mid\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}(U)=U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad f^*(\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}(U))=\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,Y}(f^*U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad f^*(\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}(U))=\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,Y}(f^*U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_m:\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)\\to\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A),\\qquad R_m(V)\\coloneqq m^*V.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_m:\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)\\to\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A),\\qquad R_m(V)\\coloneqq m^*V.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_m:\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A)\\to\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B),\\qquad T_m([v])\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,B}(\\mathrm{Im}(m\\circ v)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_m:\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A)\\to\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B),\\qquad T_m([v])\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,B}(\\mathrm{Im}(m\\circ v)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_m\\circ T_m=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A)},\\qquad T_m\\circ R_m=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_m\\circ T_m=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A)},\\qquad T_m\\circ R_m=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall V,W\\in\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)\\quad V\\leq_B W\\Longleftrightarrow R_m(V)\\leq_A R_m(W).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall V,W\\in\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)\\quad V\\leq_B W\\Longleftrightarrow R_m(V)\\leq_A R_m(W).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.2 Lemma 3，印刷225–226页，DjVu118–119；换基公式是 V.1 的自然闭包条件，并在该引理证明中实际使用。本条逐项核对了原书陈述与证明，采用子对象同构类重述。</p>\n<p>换基公式来自特征箭头：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{f^*\\mathrm{Cl}(U)}=j\\chi_Uf=\\chi_{\\mathrm{Cl}(f^*U)}\">\\(\\chi_{f^*\\mathrm{Cl}(U)}=j\\chi_Uf=\\chi_{\\mathrm{Cl}(f^*U)}\\)</span>。换代表 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 不改变复合单射的子对象类，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_m\">\\(T_m\\)</span> 良定义。对闭 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m^*\\mathrm{Cl}(\\mathrm{Im}(mv))=\\mathrm{Cl}(U)=U\">\\(m^*\\mathrm{Cl}(\\mathrm{Im}(mv))=\\mathrm{Cl}(U)=U\\)</span>。对闭 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Im}(m\\,m^*V)=V\\wedge_B[m]\">\\(\\mathrm{Im}(m\\,m^*V)=V\\wedge_B[m]\\)</span>，其闭包等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\wedge_B\\top_B=V\">\\(V\\wedge_B\\top_B=V\\)</span>。两函数都单调，因此给出序同构。稠密性是第二个复合等于恒等所必需的条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","status":"resolved","id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-dense-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"ce0c3e433ca617db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-dense-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image","status":"resolved","id":"b51ff4f43221971d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-subobject-lattice-operations","status":"resolved","id":"1289398555ba3eed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-subobject-lattice-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure","status":"resolved","id":"f2ca2aad80752c90","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega$ 为 LT 拓扑。将 [[14-df-lawvere-tierney-closure]] 的闭包显式记为 $\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}$，其定义域为 $\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)$。$f:Y\\to X$ 为任意箭头，$m:A\\hookrightarrow B$ 为 $j$-稠密单射。下式定义闭子对象集合及函数 $R_m,T_m$；$v:D\\hookrightarrow A$ 是输入子对象 $[v]$ 的任意代表。所有子对象序、逆像和像使用本书内建定义。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(X)$ 是本条新定义的集合；$\\mathrm{Im}$ 使用 [[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]] 的像函数。$\\mathrm{id}_S:S\\to S$ 在本条的闭子对象集合上表示集合恒等函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\Omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)","display":false},{"tex":"f:Y\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"m:A\\hookrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"R_m,T_m","display":false},{"tex":"v:D\\hookrightarrow A","display":false},{"tex":"[v]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Im}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}_S:S\\to S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(X)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\mid\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}(U)=U\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(X)\\quad f^*(\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,X}(U))=\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,Y}(f^*U).","display":true},{"tex":"R_m:\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)\\to\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A),\\qquad R_m(V)\\coloneqq m^*V.","display":true},{"tex":"T_m:\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A)\\to\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B),\\qquad T_m([v])\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,B}(\\mathrm{Im}(m\\circ v)).","display":true},{"tex":"R_m\\circ T_m=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A)},\\qquad T_m\\circ R_m=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall V,W\\in\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(B)\\quad V\\leq_B W\\Longleftrightarrow R_m(V)\\leq_A R_m(W).","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_{f^*\\mathrm{Cl}(U)}=j\\chi_Uf=\\chi_{\\mathrm{Cl}(f^*U)}","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"T_m","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"m^*\\mathrm{Cl}(\\mathrm{Im}(mv))=\\mathrm{Cl}(U)=U","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Im}(m\\,m^*V)=V\\wedge_B[m]","display":false},{"tex":"V\\wedge_B\\top_B=V","display":false}],"bytes":2789,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-192","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change|thm-274 — 闭包的换基自然性与稠密单射上的闭子对象]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]"},{"id":"b2640a98d95a570c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"闭包扩张性给出 $[m_A]\\leq[n_A]$，所以 $d_A$ 存在；$n_A$ 单保证唯一，且 $d_A$ 也单。由[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]的换基公式，$\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,a_j(A)}([d_A])=n_A^*\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,W_A}([m_A])=n_A^*[n_A]=\\top_{a_j(A)}$，故 $d_A$ 在 $a_j(A)$ 中稠密。$W_A$ 是层且 $[n_A]$ 闭，故[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]保证 $a_j(A)$ 是层。定义的输出因代表选择而变化时，有唯一相容同构；[[14-thm-lt-sheafification-adjunction]]给出其完整泛性质和函子作用。本构造适用于任意初等拓扑斯，不需要先给它选一个站点。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-60","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-199","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change|thm-274 — 闭包的换基自然性与稠密单射上的闭子对象]]"},{"id":"59d5dc773385bba2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2529efea1cd2e435","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j,a_j(A),\\eta_A$ 使用[[14-df-lt-sheafification-object]]的固定选择。$\\mathcal H=\\mathbf{Sh}_j(\\mathcal E)$，$i:\\mathcal H\\to\\mathcal E$ 是满子范畴包含函子，见[[14-df-lawvere-tierney-sheaf-category]]、[[14-df-functor-full-subcategory]]。对满子范畴沿用环境箭头身份；$B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal H)$，$f:A\\to A'$ 为环境箭头。下式先断言对象的层性和泛性质，再据唯一描述定义箭头作用 $a_{j,1}$、函子 $a_j$ 及 $\\Phi_{A,B}$。$\\mathrm{ClSub}_j(A)$ 见[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]。$\\chi_U^j:A\\to\\Omega_j$ 表示由 $e_j\\chi_U^j=\\chi_U$ 唯一确定的闭子对象特征箭头。$\\chi_V^j:a_j(A)\\to\\Omega_j$ 为[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]的层分类箭头。"},{"id":"d179a7fa180f99f9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a169ef2f5263224b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对稠密 $m:A\\hookrightarrow E$，$\\mathrm{Hom}(E,L)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Hom}(A,L)$ 分别为各分量 Hom 集的极限。分量限制映射的单射或双射性质传到极限；在层的情形，逐分量唯一延拓自动与锥箭头相容。指数转置把对 $G^B$ 的限制映射化为对 $G$ 沿 $m\\times1_B$ 的限制映射；该单射是 $m$ 沿投影的拉回，依[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]仍稠密。故分离性和层性都保持。两个对象集合均在固定 $\\mathcal V$-范畴内取子集，所写量化不会引入真类量化。"}],"outgoing":["f2ca2aad80752c90","ce0c3e433ca617db","b51ff4f43221971d","1289398555ba3eed","4cd3b0d29b80beda"]}